<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said it would auction 3.0 billion pesos worth of Cetes at the primary auction on Monday, April 28.</p>
<p>It will also auction Bondes and UDI bonds.</p>
<p>The auction will be held one day earlier than usual because of a holiday in Mexico on Thursday.</p>
<p>CETES</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    29  days     800 million pesos  19.92 pct</p>
<p>    92  days     800 million pesos  20.77 pct</p>
<p>    183 days     800 million pesos  20.17 pct</p>
<p>    337 days     600 million pesos  19.38 pct</p>
<p>BONDES</p>
<p>    729 days     900 million pesos  100.0 pct</p>
<p>UDIBONOS</p>
<p>    1,065 days   250 million UDIs   99.99429</p>
<p>    1,751 days   250 million UDIs   99.98934</p>
<p>((--Robert Kozak, Mexico City newsroom 525 7289559))</p>
